    preview: "Spain’s Sanchez says US voters rejected hate and elite privilege Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez has welcomed the US election results, saying voters rejected hate, machismo, climate denialism and privileges for the elite. In a post on X, he predicted Spain would follow the same political course: “It happened in Brazil. It just happened in the US. And it will happen soon in Spain.” Ayer, la sociedad estadounidense votó contra las políticas que solo empobrecen. Contra el odio. Contra el machismo.",
